<title>BELGIUM: Floridienne final 1996 profit up 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Floridienne final 1996 profit up 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results for year to December 31, 1996. (millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		121.95    vs    90.17</p>
<p>    Cons net			  128.23    vs    91.14</p>
<p>    Turnover			2,687.83    vs 2,376.73</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		30   vs	  20</p>
<p>NOTE - Floridienne, a Belgian holding company with interests in the chemical and agri-foods sector, said that all things being equal it expected 1997 to show an improvement on 1996.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
